WEBVTT

00:07:29.278 --> 00:07:34.116
is an understanding that it’s almost
inevitable that you’re detached a bit,

00:07:34.158 --> 00:07:36.619
and you need to do
a lot more work, actually,

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:39.413
to really find out
what matters to employees.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.958
So third point,

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:47.338
inaction is as political as action.

00:07:47.379 --> 00:07:52.760
We’ve met quite a few leaders that say
that they’re neutral on certain issues

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:54.720
or apolitical.

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:57.598
There's no such thing.

00:07:59.433 --> 00:08:06.357
Inaction on things like climate change
is as political as action.